# **What's on - African drumming private tuition Sunshine Coast March 2014**

We now have 4 spaces open on Mondays for Private tuition classes on African djembe and dundun. Benefits of private tuition include:

-   in-depth accompaniment focus
-   convenient time of your choice
-   individual level specific
-   rhythm choice
-   one on one dundun lessons
-   solo guidance
-   professional advice on style and technique
-   timing and rhythmic feeling

Cost: $50 per session Ph 0434585992 to grab one of these spots or email: info@rhythmculture.com.au
